# Always deploy + restart

After any change that affects the live Telegram bot (`bot.py`, generators used by it, `config_bot.py`, etc.):

1. Deploy yourself — do **not** ask the user to restart
2. Run: `python deploy/deploy.py` (or pass changed files / `--full`)
3. Confirm `receipt-bot` is **active** on the VPS (`/opt/receipt-bot`)

Credentials live in `deploy/.deploy.env` (not committed). Never print passwords or bot tokens.
